{"heroId":8,"art":{"card":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/engineer_card.webp","background":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/backgrounds/mcginnis_bg.webp","vertical":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/engineer_vertical.webp"},"text":{"en":{"role":"Controls the battle with combat turrets","playstyle":"Precise placement is everything for McGinnis, whether she's creating a killzone or splitting the enemy team. She can help keep her team running making them hard to dislodge when entrenched.","lore":"Maggie McGinnis always had a knack for building things.  At 4 she was using Lincoln Logs to recreate architectural marvels.  At 10 she built and rewired a custom light fixture for her parent's anniversary.  At 15 she designed a machine that refined the souls of the dead...that last one got a little more attention than the Lincoln Logs.\n\nNow the head of Fairfax Industries Military R&D department, McGinnis spends her time in the machine shop, not in a lab.  She's not interested in theory, to her science is magic you can touch.","tags":["Inventor","Support","Disruption"]},"es":{"role":"Controla la batalla con torretas de combate","playstyle":"Tanto si está creando una zona letal como dividiendo al equipo enemigo, la ubicación precisa lo es todo para McGinnis. Cuando sus aliados están atrincherados, puede impedir que el enemigo los expulse para ayudar a su equipo a seguir adelante.","lore":"Maggie McGinnis siempre tuvo un don para construir cosas. A los 4 años, utilizaba juegos de bloques para recrear maravillas arquitectónicas. A los 10 años, construyó y recableó una lámpara personalizada para el aniversario de sus padres. A los 15 años, diseñó una máquina que refinaba las almas de los muertos... y esta última acaparó un poco más de atención que las maquetas con bloques.\n\nActualmente, McGinnis dirige el departamento de I+D militar de Fairfax Industries y pasa la mayor parte de su tiempo en el taller mecánico, no en un laboratorio. No le interesa la teoría: para ella la ciencia es magia hecha realidad.","tags":["Inventora","Apoyo","Disruptiva"]}},"abilities":{"en":[{"id":3133377790,"slot":1,"ultimate":false,"name":"Mini Turret","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/engineer_turret.webp","video":{"mp4":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/videos/hero_abilities/ability_forge_turret_h264.mp4","webm":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/videos/hero_abilities/ability_forge_turret.webm"},"quip":[{"t":"Deploy an automated turret"}],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"Deploy a turret that shoots enemies, dealing "},{"t":"spirit damage over time","attr":"SpiritDPS","icon":"attr_SpiritDPS"},{"t":". The turret expires after a limited lifetime. "},{"t":"Turrets deal reduced damage to troopers and objectives.","dim":true}],"groups":[{"stats":[{"label":"Turret DPS","value":"24","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/damage_magic_color.svg","spirit":0.42},{"label":"Turret Health","value":"100","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/health.svg"},{"label":"Attack Range","value":"30m","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/range.svg"}]}],"basics":[{"label":"Lifetime","value":"35","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/duration.svg"}]}],"cooldown":{"label":"Cooldown","value":"18","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/cooldown.svg"},"upgrades":[[{"t":"+10","hi":true},{"t":" Turret DPS and "},{"t":"+10m","hi":true},{"t":" Attack Range"}],[{"t":"+2 Charges","hi":true}],[{"t":"+25%","hi":true},{"t":" Turret Fire Rate and "},{"t":"+12s","hi":true},{"t":" Turret Lifetime"}]]},{"id":2142734020,"slot":2,"ultimate":false,"name":"Medicinal Specter","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets